{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>למען תחזקו.</b> It does not say, 'Perform the commandments for their own sake, למען תחזקו' — for if so, it would be on condition to receive reward. Rather, this is what it says: perform the commandment out of love, for because of this you will grow strong. And למען is not attached to the word after it. And likewise למען תאריכון ימים."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:00:46.312146337Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}